# Angelina Hybrid Cloud — DuckDNS updater cron fragment (Task 12.3)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# STAGED ARTIFACT — NOT installed automatically. See README.md before applying.
#
# Keeps YOUR_SUBDOMAIN.duckdns.org pointed at the VM's current ephemeral IP.
# Runs every 5 minutes and once at boot. The script reads DUCKDNS_TOKEN from
# /opt/angelina/.env and logs to /var/log/angelina/duckdns.log.
#
# Install location on the VM (referenced below):
#   /opt/angelina/deploy/duckdns-update.sh  (chmod +x)
#
# Requirements: 8.4 (keep the DuckDNS A-record current for Caddy TLS).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- every 5 minutes ---
*/5 * * * * /opt/angelina/deploy/duckdns-update.sh >/dev/null 2>&1

# --- once at boot (ephemeral IP may change after a stop/start) ---
@reboot /opt/angelina/deploy/duckdns-update.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
